sglang-sm89
Copyright 2026 Mert Ozoner

This software includes runtime plugins and CUDA sm_89 kernels engineered for
SGLang (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang) and interoperates
with XGrammar and Triton Block-FP8 / Gated DeltaNet execution backends.

All hooks register dynamically via SGLang's HookRegistry without patching
upstream SGLang source files in place.
